<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>At Ease HQ | Veteran Support. Real Brotherhood. Real Direction.</title>
  <meta
    name="description"
    content="At Ease HQ is a veteran-led mission focused on transition support, PTSD conversations, community, guidance, claim readiness education, and veteran housing."
  />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #08111f;
      --bg-soft: #0d1a2d;
      --panel: rgba(12, 26, 45, 0.88);
      --line: rgba(114, 149, 190, 0.2);
      --text: #e7eef8;
      --muted: #9eb2ca;
      --infantry-blue: #234c7a;
      --infantry-blue-2: #2f6aa8;
      --accent: #7ea8d9;
      --sand: #b9a47a;
      --danger: #6c7a89;
      --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      --radius: 18px;
      --max: 1180px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(6, 12, 22, 0.86), rgba(6, 12, 22, 0.94)),
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(47,106,168,0.16), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(126,168,217,0.10), transparent 28%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .container {
      width: min(92%, var(--max));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      background: rgba(6, 12, 22, 0.72);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 76px;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .brand-sub {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--infantry-blue), var(--infantry-blue-2));
      color: white;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--text);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 90px 0 70px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 36px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(126,168,217,0.28);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(126,168,217,0.08);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.7rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      max-width: 760px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .hero-cta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .hero-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .stat {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .stat strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: white;
    }

    .stat span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .hero-card {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(35,76,122,0.25), rgba(6,12,22,0.88)),
        var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-card::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 0,
          rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 6px,
          transparent 6px,
          transparent 14px
        );
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .card-label {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero-card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .checklist {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .check {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    section {
      padding: 72px 0;
    }

    .section-head {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 3rem);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .section-head p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .mission-band {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(35,76,122,0.16), rgba(126,168,217,0.04));
    }

    .mission-quote {
      font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.4;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
      color: #f3f7fb;
    }

    .founder {
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .founder-panel {
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    .founder-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .founder-list div {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .cta-box {
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(35,76,122,0.32), rgba(8,17,31,0.96)),
        var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .cta-box h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .cta-box p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 30px 0 50px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .footer-wrap {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .small {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .hero-grid,
      .grid-3,
      .grid-2 {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero-stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .nav {
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 14px 0;
      }

      .nav-links {
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-title">At Ease HQ</div>
        <div class="brand-sub">Veteran-Led | Mission Driven | Infantry Built</div>
      </div>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#mission">Mission</a>
        <a href="#services">What We Do</a>
        <a href="#founder">Founder</a>
        <a href="#programs">Programs</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">Join the Mission</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Battle-Tested Leadership. Real Veteran Support.</div>
          <h1>Where Veterans Regroup, Reset, and Rebuild.</h1>
          <p>
            At Ease HQ is a veteran-led mission created to bridge the gap between isolation
            and direction. Built by a former Army Infantryman with 17 years of service,
            this platform exists to give veterans a place for honest conversations about PTSD,
            transition support, guidance, claim-readiness education, community, purpose,
            and long-term stability.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Stand With Us</a>
            <a href="#services" class="btn btn-secondary">See the Mission</a>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-stats">
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>17</strong>
              <span>Years of military leadership and service behind the mission</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>1</strong>
              <span>Clear goal: help veterans find direction, support, and purpose</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>100%</strong>
              <span>Built from lived experience, not theory</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="card-label">Mission Brief</div>
          <h3>At Ease HQ Operating Picture</h3>
          <div class="checklist">
            <div class="check">Veteran community and peer support</div>
            <div class="check">PTSD conversations without judgment</div>
            <div class="check">Transition guidance and career direction</div>
            <div class="check">Claim-readiness education and support</div>
            <div class="check">Long-term vision for veteran housing and family stability</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="mission" class="mission-band">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="mission-quote">
          “At Ease HQ was built for the veteran who stayed quiet too long, carried too much,
          and still showed up. This is where that burden gets met with structure, brotherhood,
          and a new mission.”
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>What We Do</h2>
          <p>
            We are building a support ecosystem for veterans and their families with a focus
            on real conversations, practical guidance, and long-term stability.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Veteran Support</h3>
            <p>
              We create a space where veterans can talk openly about PTSD, transition,
              identity loss, and real-life struggles without feeling judged or dismissed.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Claim Readiness Education</h3>
            <p>
              We help veterans organize their story, prepare their documents, and better
              understand the process so they can submit stronger claims with confidence.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Career & Transition Guidance</h3>
            <p>
              We help bridge the gap between military service and civilian opportunity by
              supporting direction, confidence, and next-step planning.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Community Building</h3>
            <p>
              At Ease HQ is designed to reconnect veterans to people who understand the
              weight they carry and the mission mindset they still live by.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Spouse & Family Support</h3>
            <p>
              Strong families matter. Our long-term vision includes support systems that
              help veteran households stay connected, informed, and stable.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Veteran Housing Vision</h3>
            <p>
              We are building toward affordable veteran-focused housing solutions that go
              beyond temporary help and create long-term security and dignity.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="founder">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Built by Experience</h2>
          <p>
            At Ease HQ was not created from a trend. It was created from service, leadership,
            transition, struggle, and the decision to keep helping others after the uniform came off.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-2 founder">
          <div class="card founder-panel">
            <h3>Founder</h3>
            <p>
              Henry Alvarado is a recently separated Army Infantryman, combat veteran,
              and mission-driven leader who built At Ease HQ after seeing firsthand how many
              veterans struggle in silence with PTSD, the VA system, transition, purpose,
              and knowing where to turn next.
            </p>

            <div class="founder-list">
              <div>17 years of service and leadership experience</div>
              <div>Veteran-focused, community-centered mission</div>
              <div>Built to serve those still fighting battles after service</div>
              <div>Focused on guidance, structure, and long-term impact</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card founder-panel">
            <h3>Why This Exists</h3>
            <p>
              Too many veterans are expected to “be fine” after service, even when they are
              carrying trauma, pressure, financial stress, relationship strain, or uncertainty
              about the future. At Ease HQ exists to become the bridge — the place where
              veterans can regroup, get oriented, and move forward with support.
            </p>

            <div class="founder-list">
              <div>No fake motivation. Real talk.</div>
              <div>No judgment. Just support, direction, and community.</div>
              <div>Built with an infantry mindset: disciplined, direct, mission-first.</div>
              <div>Designed to grow into a national platform for veteran impact.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="programs">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Mission Lanes</h2>
          <p>
            The platform is designed to grow in phases while staying grounded in one core mission:
            helping veterans feel seen, supported, and equipped to keep moving.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Debriefing & Conversation</h3>
            <p>
              Honest conversations for veterans who need a place to process what they are carrying
              and reconnect with people who understand.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Education & Readiness</h3>
            <p>
              Tools, templates, and support for veterans preparing to advocate for themselves,
              especially when navigating claims and transition issues.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Housing & Stability</h3>
            <p>
              A long-range effort to build veteran-centered housing pathways that combine dignity,
              structure, and opportunity for families who need a reset.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-box">
          <h2>Join the Mission</h2>
          <p>
            Whether you are a veteran, spouse, supporter, community partner, donor,
            or someone looking to stand in the gap for those who served, At Ease HQ is building
            something bigger than a brand. We are building a rally point.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-cta" style="justify-content:center;">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:info@ateasehq.org">Email Us</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Instagram</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
          <p class="small" style="margin-top: 18px;">
            Replace the email and social links above with your real At Ease HQ contact info.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-wrap">
      <div>
        <strong>At Ease HQ</strong><br />
        <span class="small">Veteran-Led. Mission-Driven. Built for the battles after service.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="small">
        © <span id="year"></span> At Ease HQ. All Rights Reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
